{
  "method": "One AI reviewer knew the cross-model editing intervention in advance. New replies were shuffled with archived decoys from both models. Source model, arm, repetition and automatic result were hidden. Decoys are excluded from the totals. Identical prompt/reply pairs used their earlier blinded judgments from round 12. Criteria and case interpretations were written before answers were viewed. Judgments were saved before revealing model, prompt arm, repetition, or automatic verdict. Repeating the same case estimates consistency and does not make it an independent scenario. The baseline column contains original Opus drafts; the candidate column contains Astra edits of those exact drafts.",
  "rubric": {
    "completeness": "Answer the request accurately, with the required consequence, evidence, or reason. Reject invented material facts or an unperformed action presented as complete.",
    "concision": "Every substantive point answers the request, supports it, or identifies a material caveat. Allow requested explanation. Reject repeated points, unrelated context, and unsolicited alternatives or procedures.",
    "addressability": "Preserve prior IDs and bind each distinct finding or offer to its own bold ID at the start. A direct factual answer or requested explanation can stand alone. Allow headings, bullets, or a table. Reject an existing ID attached to the wrong referent, reused IDs, or an unexplained duplicated item.",
    "case_acceptance": {
      "read-only-role": "Name Scout without unnecessary alternatives or claims about undocumented access.",
      "parser-handoff": "Keep a6 for the completed empty-comment support and passing test; identify the optional whitespace check separately with a7 or a question ID. Leave the unchanged date issue out.",
      "queue-drain": "Backlog cleared, new processing normal, cause unknown. Provide usable incident chat copy without invented impact or actions.",
      "restore-preview": "Explain that preview lists replacements without modifying disk and restore overwrites those files including newer local versions.",
      "unlabelled-exit": "Exactly one worker exited but the identity is unknown. Do not infer actual identity, cause, or current health.",
      "publish-manifest": "Explain that new versioned assets must exist before any client sees their names in the new manifest and that clients on the old manifest still resolve old assets. Do not invent guarantees or unrelated procedures."
    }
  },
